# $apply with sparse/non-sequential integer keys: sorted by key value
[
  f: [fn [x y] [str x y]]
  args: [3: "b" 1: "a"]
  result: [apply f args]
]
=== out
Dict({"f": Function(x, y), "args": Dict({3: String("b"), 1: String("a")}), "result": String("ab")})
=== warn
arity mismatch: expected 2 arguments, got 1 at 1:1-5:2
